Perform authorization transaction to check if the card can actually be charged
post
https://api.icount.co.il/api/v3.php/cc/validate_card_cvv
Request
Body

application/json

cid
string
Company identifier

user
string
Username

pass
string
Password

cc_number
number
required
Card number

cc_validity
number
required
Card validity month in either YYYY-MM or MMYY format

cc_cvv
number
required
Card verivication code (CVV/CSC)

cc_holder_id
number
required
Card holder VAT ID

Responses
200
OK

